a164707c Load the module under test before the test starts, not inside its 5 second budget
Tests that awaited a dynamic import inside the test body counted module loading as test time, so they failed with timeouts only when the full suite loaded the machine. The cron sweep, the accounts, wealth and recurring pages and the message remount test now load their code while the file is collected; the accounts page no longer needs its 30 second timeout.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Entire-Checkpoint: 01M7J4WGK4D126YCXMQ1YQ23B6

0f90a8e0 Load background workflows only when a run is started
The agent, bank-sync and financial-review dispatchers imported their whole workflow (AI models, organizer, importer) when the module loaded, so every route and page that only reads or checks authorization paid for it. They now import the workflow at the moment they start it. The cron route sweep drops from 9 to 75 seconds of import time to about 3.

